<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55041" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταρρῑνάω</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταρριζ-έω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίνη</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>file down, make thin</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχναίνων καὶ καταρινῶν τὰ συγκρίματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antyll.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.37.16
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατερρινημένον τι λέγειν</span>
			<i>polished, elegant</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				901
			</span></i>; of men, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βραχίον᾽ εὖ
				κατερρινημένους</span>, i. e. <i>having had all superfluous
				flesh worked off</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				747
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατερρινωμένους</span>
			<i>covered with shields</i>, Wellauer; cf. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατερρινωμένον:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπεπυκασμένον,
			καταδεδερματωμένον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
